// Matcha-D: "要件" は「要件」の別表記（英文のため）
#Taking^Fifth Amendment <= the city: (
    "public use" <= the stadium is open to everyone@a public use &
    !"just compensation" <= the owner's offer was refused
) >> the taking is lawful as taking

#Objection <= the city: (
    "private benefit" <= a single developer profits@mainly private
) >> not the taking is lawful as objection

:: priority $objection > $taking
